9. Renaming

| Method       | Use                        | Example                              |
| ------------ | -------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |
| `rename()`   | Rename columns/rows        | `df.rename(columns={"Age":"Years"})` |
| `set_axis()` | Change column/index labels | `df.set_axis(["A","B"], axis=1)`     |

===

Example:

df.rename(
    columns={"Age": "Years"},
    inplace=True
)

====
